[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m (300 \cos \theta - 468 \sin \theta + 24 \cos \theta + 36 \sin \theta) + i(300 \sin \theta + 468 \cos \theta + 24 \sin \theta - 36 \cos \theta).
