[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m Let's represent \(z\) in its polar form. Since \(|z| = 4\), we can write \(z = 4e^{i\theta} = 4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m Substituting \(z = 4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)\) into the expression, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m (75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = (75 + 117i)4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)}.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m First, let's simplify the terms separately:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m (75 + 117i)4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) = 4(75\cos\theta + 75i\sin\theta + 117i\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta) = 4((75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta) + i(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta)).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)} = \frac{(96 + 144i)(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta)}{4(\cos^2\theta + \sin^2\theta)} = \frac{96\cos\theta + 144\sin\theta + i(144\cos\theta - 96\sin\theta)}{4} = (24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta) + i(36\cos\theta - 24\sin\theta).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m Combining these, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 4((75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta) + i(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta)) + (24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta) + i(36\cos\theta - 24\sin\theta).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m = (4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta) + 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta) + i(4(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta) + 36\cos\theta - 24\sin\theta).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \[
