[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m The real part of this expression is \(324\cos\theta - 432\sin\theta\). To find the maximum value of this expression, we can use the method of finding the maximum value of a linear combination of sine and cosine functions. The maximum value of \(a\cos\theta + b\sin\theta\) is \(\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}\).
