[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 2. Substitute \(z\) into the expression and simplify.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m The expression becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m (75 + 117i)(4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)}.
