[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m Next, simplify the term \(\frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)}\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \[
