[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m Let's represent \(z\) in its polar form. Since \(|z| = 4\), we can write \(z = 4e^{i\theta} = 4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)\). Now we can substitute this into the expression and simplify.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m The expression becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m (75 + 117i) \cdot 4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m First, let's simplify the multiplication and division:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m (75 + 117i) \cdot 4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta) = 4(75 \cos \theta + 75i \sin \theta + 117i \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta) = 4(75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta + i (75 \sin \theta + 117 \cos \theta))
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)} \cdot \frac{\cos \theta - i \sin \theta}{\cos \theta - i \sin \theta} = \frac{(96 + 144i)(\cos \theta - i \sin \theta)}{4(\cos^2 \theta + \sin^2 \theta)} = \frac{96 \cos \theta + 144 \sin \theta + i (144 \cos \theta - 96 \sin \theta)}{4} = 24 \cos \theta + 36 \sin \theta + i (36 \cos \theta - 24 \sin \theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m So the expression becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 4(75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta + i (75 \sin \theta + 117 \cos \theta)) + 24 \cos \theta + 36 \sin \theta + i (36 \cos \theta - 24 \sin \theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m = 300 \cos \theta - 468 \sin \theta + 24 \cos \theta + i (300 \sin \theta + 468 \cos \theta + 36 \cos \theta - 24 \sin \theta)
