[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m Find the largest possible real part of \[(75+117i)z+\frac{96+144i}{z}\]where $z$ is a complex number with $|z|=4$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m Remember to put your answer on its own line after "Answer:".
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m assistant
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m [response] To solve the problem, we need to maximize the real part of the expression \((75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z}\) where \(z\) is a complex number with \(|z| = 4\). Let's represent \(z\) in its polar form as \(z = 4e^{i\theta} = 4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m First, we substitute \(z = 4e^{i\theta}\) into the expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m (75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = (75 + 117i)4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m Simplifying the first term:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m (75 + 117i)4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta) = 4(75 \cos \theta + 75i \sin \theta + 117i \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta) = 4((75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta) + i(75 \sin \theta + 117 \cos \theta))
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m Simplifying the second term:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4} \cdot \frac{\cos \theta - i \sin \theta}{\cos^2 \theta + \sin^2 \theta} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4} (\cos \theta - i \sin \theta) = (24 - 36i)(\cos \theta - i \sin \theta) = (24 \cos \theta + 36 \sin \theta) - i(24 \sin \theta - 36 \cos \theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m Combining both terms:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 4((75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta) + i(75 \sin \theta + 117 \cos \theta)) + (24 \cos \theta + 36 \sin \theta) - i(24 \sin \theta - 36 \cos \theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m Separating the real and imaginary parts:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \text{Real part} = 4(75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta) + 24 \cos \theta + 36 \sin \theta = 300 \cos \theta - 468 \sin \theta + 24 \cos \theta + 36 \sin \theta = 324 \cos \theta - 432 \sin \theta
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m We need to maximize the expression \(324 \cos \theta - 432 \sin \theta\). This can be written as:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 324 \cos \theta - 432 \sin \theta = 540 \left( \frac{324}{540} \cos \theta - \frac{432}{540} \sin \theta \right) = 540 \left( \frac{324}{540} \cos \theta - \frac{432}{540} \sin \theta \right) = 540 \left( \frac{9}{15} \cos \theta - \frac{12}{15} \sin \theta \right) = 540 \left( \frac{3}{5} \cos \theta - \frac{4}{5} \sin \theta \right)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m Let \(\cos \phi = \frac{3}{5}\) and \(\sin \phi = \frac{4}{5}\). Then the expression becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 540 \left( \cos \phi \cos \theta - \sin \phi \sin \theta \right) = 540 \cos(\theta + \phi)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m The maximum value of \(\cos(\theta + \phi)\) is 1, so the maximum value of the real part is \(540 \cdot 1 = 540\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=798490)[0m Thus, the largest possible real part of the given expression is \(\boxed{540}\).
